# Profile of the person using the app (core, `profile`; docs/profile.md): the welcome
# questionnaire (questions and options), level names and errors.
# Revision: AI draft, not yet reviewed by a native speaker.

nucleo-perfil-nivel-iniciante = Beginner
nucleo-perfil-nivel-intermediario = Intermediate
nucleo-perfil-nivel-avancado = Advanced
nucleo-perfil-erro-pergunta = unknown question: { $pergunta }
nucleo-perfil-erro-uma-resposta = question { $pergunta } accepts only one answer
nucleo-perfil-erro-opcao = unknown option in { $pergunta }: { $opcao }
nucleo-perfil-erro-so-interface = the profile can only be changed in the app

## Questionnaire

nucleo-perfil-confianca = How do you feel about managing your money?
nucleo-perfil-confianca-nada = Not confident at all: I want to learn the basics
nucleo-perfil-confianca-mais-ou-menos = So-so: I know some things, but I need help
nucleo-perfil-confianca-bastante = Fairly confident: I already keep good track
nucleo-perfil-confianca-muito = Very confident: I understand investments and advanced strategies

nucleo-perfil-controle = Do you already write down or track your spending?
nucleo-perfil-controle-nunca = No, I've never tracked it
nucleo-perfil-controle-as-vezes = Sometimes, in my head or on paper
nucleo-perfil-controle-planilha = Yes, with a spreadsheet or a simple app
nucleo-perfil-controle-detalhado = Yes, in detail and regularly

nucleo-perfil-objetivo = What do you want most right now with your money?
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-dica = You can choose more than one.
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-onde-vai = Know where my money is going
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-reserva = Build an emergency fund
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-dividas = Get out of debt or reduce it
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-objetivo = Save for a goal (a trip, a renovation…)
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-organizar = Better organize what I already do
nucleo-perfil-objetivo-investir = Invest and make my money grow

nucleo-perfil-reserva = And an emergency fund (money set aside for the unexpected)?
nucleo-perfil-reserva-nao-sei = I don't know what that is
nucleo-perfil-reserva-nao-tenho = I know what it is, but I don't have one yet
nucleo-perfil-reserva-um-pouco = I have a little, but not enough
nucleo-perfil-reserva-suficiente = I have enough (3 to 6 months of expenses)

nucleo-perfil-renda = What is your main income like?
nucleo-perfil-renda-dica = It helps tailor the tips; it doesn't change the level.
nucleo-perfil-renda-fixa = Fixed and predictable (a salary or similar)
nucleo-perfil-renda-variavel = Variable (freelance, commission, self-employed, side jobs)
nucleo-perfil-renda-beneficios = Government benefits (retirement, pension, assistance or others)
nucleo-perfil-renda-mista = Mixed (a salary plus benefits or variable income)
nucleo-perfil-renda-nao-informar = I'd rather not say for now

nucleo-perfil-termos = When you see terms like “compound interest”, “real return” or “asset allocation”…
nucleo-perfil-termos-perdido = I don't understand them and get lost
nucleo-perfil-termos-mais-ou-menos = I understand them more or less
nucleo-perfil-termos-entendo = I understand them well and use them every day

nucleo-perfil-tom = How would you like the app to talk to you?
nucleo-perfil-tom-simples = Very simply, with explanations and everyday examples
nucleo-perfil-tom-equilibrado = Balanced: clear, but without talking down
nucleo-perfil-tom-tecnico = Detailed and technical, with in-depth analysis
